Adds a search button for unlinked activity queue elements in [b]Radarr[/b] and [b]Sonarr[/b].

This is a Tampermonkey userscript that helps with queue entries that do not get matched cleanly (eg. when added to the client but no entry in Radarr/Sonarr yet).

For affected rows in the activity queue, the script adds a [b]search button[/b] right next to the status icon and moves the existing user/details button there as well.
Instead of copying the name by hand, you can just click the new search button and jump straight into the add/search page
